# EXCP Time TestCases repo

This repository is the **canonical** home for manual test specs, SQL fixtures, run status, and ad-hoc **`queries/`** scripts.

## Daily workflow (no vendor repo required)

1. Edit `test-cases/**` per **`docs/standards/test-case-format.md`**.
2. Commit and push to GitHub with the app repos.
3. Update **`test-runs/current/status.json`** when QA completes a case (coordinate to avoid merge conflicts).

## Test-case GUI (bundled)

From this repo root (Node 18+). Do **not** clone Testing-feature.

```powershell
npm install
npm run ui
```

Also: `npm run doctor`, `npx tc s <KEY> ok`, `npx tc t <file>`.

Do **not** run `tc project sync` unless the team lead asks — sync can reinstall local-only gitignore blocks.

Format and delivery waves are copied into **`docs/standards/`** so teammates without the vendor clone still follow the same rules.
